ltProgress` folds behind the gather and anchored-text barriers. This is the Smelter's single outbound signal.\"\n            ]\n          }\n        ],\n        \"trailing\": \"\"\n      },\n      \"schemaDocs\": {\n        \"lead\": [],\n        \"trailing\": \"{ resourceId; contentChecksum; outcome; reason? }\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"channel\": \"weave:rebuild\",\n      \"shape\": \"schema\",\n      \"schema\": \"WeaveRebuildCommand\",\n      \"validate\": \"WeaveRebuildCommand\",\n      \"docs\": {\n        \"lead\": [\n          \"\",\n          {\n            \"comment\": [\n              \"Command \u2014 rebuild the graph projection from the event log (full when resourceId is absent, one resource when present). Served by the Weaver over the bus: a direct `rebuildAll()`/`rebuildResource()` call cannot reach a Weaver running in its own container. Correlated request/reply via the BUS_OPERATIONS registry.\"\n            ]\n          }\n        ],\n        \"trailing\": \"\"\n      },\n      \"schemaDocs\": {\n        \"lead\": [],\n        \"trailing\": \"\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"channel\": \"weave:rebuild-ok\",\n      \"shape\": \"empty\",\n      \"validate\": null,\n      \"docs\": {\n        \"lead\": [],\n        \"trailing\": \"\"\n      },\n      \"schemaDocs\": {\n        \"lead\": [],\n        \"trailing\": \"no fields\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"channel\": \"weave:rebuild-failed\",\n      \"shape\": \"schema\",\n      \"schema\": \"CommandError\",\n      \"validate\": null,\n      \"docs\": {\n        \"lead\": [],\n        \"trailing\": \"\"\n      },\n      \"schemaDocs\": {\n        \"lead\": [],\n        \"trailing\": \"CommandError\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"channel\": \"smelt:rebuild-anchors\",\n      \"shape\": \"schema\",\n      \"schema\": \"SmeltRebuildAnchorsCommand\",\n      \"validate\": \"SmeltRebuildAnchorsCommand\",\n      \"docs\": {\n        \"lead\": [\n          \"\",\n          {\n            \"comment\": [\n              \"Command \u2014 rebuild anchored-text artifacts by re-running extraction (every geometry-capable resource when resourceId is absent, one when present). Served by the Smelter, serialized, never destructive, and with ZERO embedding calls \u2014 only the derived map is re-made. Correlated request/reply via BUS_OPERATIONS.\"\n            ]\n          }\n        ],\n        \"trailing\": \"\"\n      },\n      \"schemaDocs\": {\n        \"lead\": [],\n        \"trailing\": \"\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"channel\": \"smelt:rebuild-anchors-ok\",\n      \"shape\": \"empty\",\n      \"validate\": null,\n      \"docs\": {\n        \"lead\": [],\n        \"trailing\": \"\"\n      },\n      \"schemaDocs\": {\n        \"lead\": [],\n        \"trailing\": \"no fields\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"channel\": \"smelt:rebuild-anchors-failed\",\n      \"shape\": \"schema\",\n      \"schema\": \"CommandError\",\n      \"validate\": null,\n      \"docs\": {\n        \"lead\": [],\n        \"trailing\": \"\"\n      },\n      \"schemaDocs\": {\n        \"lead\": [],\n        \"trailing\": \"CommandError\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"channel\": \"settings:theme-changed\",\n      \"shape\": \"schema\",\n      \"schema\": \"SettingsThemeChangedEvent\",\n      \"validate\": \"SettingsThemeChangedEvent\",\n      \"docs\": {\n        \"lead\": [\n          \"\",\n          {\n            \"section\": \"SETTINGS (Browser-only)\"\n          },\n          \"\"\n        ],\n        \"trailing\": \"\"\n      },\n      \"schemaDocs\": {\n        \"lead\": [\n          \"\",\n          {\n            \"section\": \"SETTINGS (Browser-only)\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"trailing\": \"\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"channel\": \"settings:line-numbers-toggled\",\n      \"shape\": \"void\",\n      \"validate\": null,\n      \"docs\": {\n        \"lead\": [],\n        \"trailing\": \"\"\n      },\n      \"schemaDocs\": {\n        \"lead\": [],\n        \